# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mixosa OS package list
# One package name per line. Lines starting with '#' are ignored by mkarchiso.
# NOTE: whitesur-gtk-theme, bottles and localsend are AUR packages and are
# NOT available in the official Arch repos used by archiso's default
# pacman.conf. See the note at the bottom of this file / the setup.sh
# comments before relying on this list to pull them in unmodified.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Base system ---
base
linux-zen
linux-zen-headers
linux-firmware
networkmanager

# --- Desktop environment (KDE Plasma) ---
plasma-desktop
sddm
dolphin
konsole

# --- Audio (PipeWire stack) ---
pipewire
pipewire-alsa
pipewire-pulse
wireplumber

# --- Theme & tools ---
whitesur-gtk-theme
wine
bottles
localsend
git
nano
sudo
